title: Comintern Subsidy
subtitle: The party's papers, offices and organisers depend on money from Moscow.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_moscow
view-if: rf_subsidy_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_subsidy_timer = 4

= Comintern Subsidy

Members' dues are worth nothing in a hyperinflation. The International's representatives can supply hard currency.

- @accept: Accept the subsidy.
- @refuse: Rely on the members.

@accept
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds += 3;
Q.autonomy -= 4;
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] += 2;
!}

The money arrives in dollars. With it come reports, instructions and representatives.

@refuse
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds += 1;
Q.autonomy += 2;
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] -= 2;
!}

You raise what you can at home. The party stays poorer and a little freer.
